{"status":"answered","model_status":"answered","answer":"Register with Disability Support Services by completing the registration form: a health professional completes Part A, and you complete Part B and Part C, all signed and dated. You can register at any time, but it is a good idea to do it before your units start.","points":[{"text":"A relative or family friend cannot complete Part A of the form.","source_id":"au-disability-register#3","quote":"Part A can’t be completed by a relative or family friend.","doc":"au-disability-register","title":"Register for disability services","section":"How to register","level":null,"campus":"au","topic":"disability","url":"https://www.monash.edu/students/support/disability/services-for-students/register","verified":true,"reason":null},{"text":"You can submit a digital copy or a PDF version of the form.","source_id":"au-disability-register#3","quote":"You can submit a digital copy or a PDF version of the form.","doc":"au-disability-register","title":"Register for disability services","section":"How to register","level":null,"campus":"au","topic":"disability","url":"https://www.monash.edu/students/support/disability/services-for-students/register","verified":true,"reason":null},{"text":"If you already have supporting documents from a health professional, you skip Part A and email DSS with those documents and signed Part C.","source_id":"au-disability-register#6","quote":"you don’t need to complete Part A of the registration form – just send an email to DSS with:","doc":"au-disability-register","title":"Register for disability services","section":"Already have supporting documents?","level":null,"campus":"au","topic":"disability","url":"https://www.monash.edu/students/support/disability/services-for-students/register","verified":true,"reason":null}],"citations":[{"source_id":"au-disability-register#3","quote":"There are three steps to complete your registration with DSS – you can register at any time, but it’s a good idea to do it 